# Review and test with: sshd -t
# Apply only after a second terminal proves the new key path.
#
# This snippet does NOT globally disable password authentication because that
# would be unsafe during bootstrap. Global hardening is a later explicit gate.

PermitRootLogin no

Match User scientiam-remoteops
    PubkeyAuthentication yes
    PasswordAuthentication no
    KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
    X11Forwarding no
    AllowAgentForwarding no
    PermitTunnel no
    GatewayPorts no
    ClientAliveInterval 60
    ClientAliveCountMax 3
